  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the extension in spring be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;the natural length of spring be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math>.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b30a18c0-ff19-40d3-bd91-f4db563d8ee0-9893994.PNG\" style=\"width: 205px; height: 90px;\" /></p><p>Here the centrifugal force will stretch&nbsp;the spring.</p><p>So, centrifugal force<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math>spring force</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>25</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>l</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
